  "name": "Bourbon-Honey Beef Brisket with Chive Mash",
  "subtitle": "Slow-braised brisket with sweet glaze and creamy potatoes",
  "description": "Tender beef brisket is slow-cooked with onions and carrots, finished with a bourbon-honey glaze, and served with soured cream and chive mash.",
